{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'gh pr view 38 --repo mrkkucharski/vgt --json number,title,state,isDraft,baseRefName,headRefName,mergeable,reviewDecision,body,commits,files,statusCheckRollup && gh issue view 34 --repo mrkkucharski/vgt --comments'","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"Closes #34\\n\\n## Changes\\n\\nSee issue #34 for details.\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-07-19T18:59:04Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"marekkucharski@mini.local\",\"id\":\"\",\"login\":\"\",\"name\":\"Marek Kucharski\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-07-19T18:59:04Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"chore: remove retired read-chords reference\",\"oid\":\"776c32ccd18024c31c0121e0cb05840f4099003e\"}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"reascript/vgt_sync.lua\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"headRefName\":\"issue-34-remove-read-chords-command-once-sync-rep\",\"isDraft\":false,\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"number\":38,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[],\"title\":\"Remove 'read-chords' command once 'sync' replaces it\"}\nauthor:\tmrkkucharski\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\nVerified that #33 absorbed the requested removal: the unified `vgt sync` command reads both chords and sections, and no `read-chords` command, action, docs, or live verification references remain. Also removed one stale internal action-name comment. Checks: `uv run pytest` (62 passed) and `uv run pytest tests/test_reascript.py tests/test_project.py -q` (24 passed). Published commit 776c32c on `issue-34-remove-read-chords-command-once-sync-rep`.\n--\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
